{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026XR3CsIMZcY1793622448.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>外交部回應朝鮮進行戰術彈道導彈試驗，和近期朝鮮半島局勢，稱希望有關方正視半島問題根源，堅持以政治解決問題。</p><p></p><p>外交部發言人毛寧指出︰「中方注意到有關報道，也注意到朝方近期針對美韓日軍事動向多次表明立場。我們希望有關方正視半島問題根源，堅持政治解決大方向，為緩和緊張局勢、維護地區和平穩定作出努力。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T14:41:30.857449+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T13:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T16:18:19.964738+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T14:38:25.045511+00:00","content_hash":"2f111dd47eda42287688e524164037cc77f73749ff0fb05ecd15de518e513fa1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T14:41:30.857449+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}